# Flutter Clean Architecture + Riverpod Project Rules

## Project Configuration
- **Flutter SDK:** 3.41.3
- **State Management:** ONLY Riverpod 2.x with riverpod_annotation + riverpod_generator
- **Navigation:** go_router (latest) for scalability
- **Architecture:** Uncle Bob's Clean Architecture

## Architecture Structure (STRICT)

```
lib/
├── core/                  ← shared only
│   ├── constants/
│   ├── di/
│   ├── error/
│   ├── extensions/
│   ├── resources/
│   ├── router/
│   ├── theme/
│   └── utils/
└── features/
    └── {feature_name}/    ← every screen/feature here
        ├── data/
        │   ├── datasources/   ← mock for now
        │   ├── models/
        │   └── repositories/  ← impl
        ├── domain/
        │   ├── entities/
        │   ├── repositories/  ← abstract only
        │   └── usecases/      ← one file per use case
        └── presentation/
            ├── providers/     ← Riverpod (notifiers, providers)
            ├── screens/
            └── widgets/
```

## Critical Rules

1. **State Management:** NEVER use setState, Provider, Bloc, etc. ONLY Riverpod with riverpod_annotation + riverpod_generator.

2. **Colors:** NEVER hard-code any color. Always use `R.appColors.*` (NOT `AppColors.*`). Import from [lib/core/resources/resources.dart](mdc:lib/core/resources/resources.dart). When updating colors, only modify app_colors.dart.

3. **Text Styles:** NEVER hard-code TextStyle. Always use `R.textStyles.poppins()`, `R.textStyles.roboto()`, etc. from [lib/core/resources/app_text_style.dart](mdc:lib/core/resources/app_text_style.dart).

4. **Spacing (Heights/Widths):** NEVER use hardcoded `SizedBox(height: 24)` or `SizedBox(width: 16)`. Always use constants from [lib/core/constants/heights_widths.dart](mdc:lib/core/constants/heights_widths.dart) like `h1`, `h2`, `h3`, `w1`, `w2`, etc. These use sizer for responsive sizing.

5. **Padding/EdgeInsets:** Use constants from heights_widths.dart or create appropriate spacing using the h/w constants.

6. **Navigation:** Use go_router for all navigation. Routes defined in [lib/core/router/app_router.dart](mdc:lib/core/router/app_router.dart).

7. **Repositories:** All repositories in data/ must use mock/in-memory data initially. When integrating API, replace ONLY the datasource with real HTTP (dio/http will be added later).

8. **Code Style:** Clean, well-commented, fully testable, highly modular and expandable. Use freezed when models become complex. Always separate concerns strictly (no business logic in presentation).

9. **Use Cases:** When use-case documents are attached, map them exactly to domain/usecases and presentation/providers.

## Development Workflow

- **"Implement feature X"** or attach use-case documents → Create the full Clean Architecture layers for that feature only (domain first → data mock → presentation with Riverpod providers).

- **"Integrate API for feature Y"** → Only modify the data/datasources and repositories (keep everything else untouched).

- **"Update colors"** → Only change [lib/core/resources/app_colors.dart](mdc:lib/core/resources/app_colors.dart) and rebuild.

## Theme & Resources

- Theme configuration: [lib/core/theme/app_theme.dart](mdc:lib/core/theme/app_theme.dart)
- Color definitions: [lib/core/resources/app_colors.dart](mdc:lib/core/resources/app_colors.dart) - Use `R.appColors.*` (NOT `AppColors.*`)
- Text styles: [lib/core/resources/app_text_style.dart](mdc:lib/core/resources/app_text_style.dart) - Use `R.textStyles.*` (NOT hardcoded `TextStyle`)
- Decorations: [lib/core/resources/app_decorations.dart](mdc:lib/core/resources/app_decorations.dart) - Use `R.appDecorations.*`
- Validators: [lib/core/resources/app_validator.dart](mdc:lib/core/resources/app_validator.dart) - Use `R.appValidator.*`
- Heights & Widths: [lib/core/constants/heights_widths.dart](mdc:lib/core/constants/heights_widths.dart) - Use `h1`, `h2`, `w1`, `w2`, etc. (NOT hardcoded `SizedBox(height: 24)`)
- App strings: Use localization with `.L()` extension - `"key".L()` (NOT hardcoded strings)
- Service locator: [lib/core/di/service_locator.dart](mdc:lib/core/di/service_locator.dart)

